{"id":"reference/enum","kind":"langref","title":"enum","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#enum","file":"reference/enum.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"enum","text":"enum"},{"depth":3,"slug":"extern-enum","text":"extern enum"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Enum-Literals","text":"枚举字面量"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Non-exhaustive-enum","text":"非穷尽枚举"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"enum\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/enum/#enum\">enum</a></h2>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_enums.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expect = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expect;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqualStrings = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqualStrings;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> mem = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).mem;\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 声明枚举。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Type = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span> {\n    ok,\n    not_ok,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 声明特定枚举字段。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> c = Type.ok;\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 如果需要访问枚举的序数值，</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可以指定标记类型。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Value = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u2</span>) {\n    zero,\n    one,\n    two,\n};\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 现在可以在 u2 和 Value 之间转换。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 序数值从零开始，相对于前一成员递增一。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"enum ordinal value\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@backingInt</span>(Value.zero));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@backingInt</span>(Value.one));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@backingInt</span>(Value.two));\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可以覆盖枚举的序数值。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Value2 = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>) {\n    hundred = <span class=\"tok-number\">100</span>,\n    thousand = <span class=\"tok-number\">1000</span>,\n    million = <span class=\"tok-number\">1000000</span>,\n};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"set enum ordinal value\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">100</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@backingInt</span>(Value2.hundred));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1000</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@backingInt</span>(Value2.thousand));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1000000</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@backingInt</span>(Value2.million));\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 也可以只覆盖部分值。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Value3 = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u4</span>) {\n    a,\n    b = <span class=\"tok-number\">8</span>,\n    c,\n    d = <span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>,\n    e,\n};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"enum implicit ordinal values and overridden values\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@backingInt</span>(Value3.a));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">8</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@backingInt</span>(Value3.b));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">9</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@backingInt</span>(Value3.c));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@backingInt</span>(Value3.d));\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@backingInt</span>(Value3.e));\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 与结构体和联合一样，枚举可以有方法。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 枚举方法并不特殊，只是命名空间中的函数，</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可以使用点语法调用。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Suit = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span> {\n    clubs,\n    spades,\n    diamonds,\n    hearts,\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">isClubs</span>(self: Suit) <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span> {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> self == Suit.clubs;\n    }\n};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"enum method\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> p = Suit.spades;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(!p.isClubs());\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可以对枚举执行 switch。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Foo = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span> {\n    string,\n    number,\n    none,\n};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"enum switch\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> p = Foo.number;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> what_is_it = <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (p) {\n        Foo.string =&gt; <span class=\"tok-str\">\"this is a string\"</span>,\n        Foo.number =&gt; <span class=\"tok-str\">\"this is a number\"</span>,\n        Foo.none =&gt; <span class=\"tok-str\">\"this is a none\"</span>,\n    };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqualStrings(what_is_it, <span class=\"tok-str\">\"this is a number\"</span>);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可以用 @typeInfo 访问枚举的整数标记类型。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Small = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span> {\n    one,\n    two,\n    three,\n    four,\n};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"std.meta.Tag\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-type\">u2</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(Small).@\"enum\".tag_type);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// @typeInfo 提供字段数量和字段名称：</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"@typeInfo\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(Small).@\"enum\".field_names.len);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqualStrings(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(Small).@\"enum\".field_names[<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>], <span class=\"tok-str\">\"two\"</span>);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// @tagName 返回枚举值的 [:0]const u8 表示：</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"@tagName\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqualStrings(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@tagName</span>(Small.three), <span class=\"tok-str\">\"three\"</span>);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 空枚举无法实例化，其标记类型始终为 noreturn。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Empty = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span> {};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"empty enum\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-type\">noreturn</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(Empty).@\"enum\".tag_type);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_enums.zig</kbd>\n1/9 test_enums.test.enum ordinal value...OK\n2/9 test_enums.test.set enum ordinal value...OK\n3/9 test_enums.test.enum implicit ordinal values and overridden values...OK\n4/9 test_enums.test.enum method...OK\n5/9 test_enums.test.enum switch...OK\n6/9 test_enums.test.std.meta.Tag...OK\n7/9 test_enums.test.@typeInfo...OK\n8/9 test_enums.test.@tagName...OK\n9/9 test_enums.test.empty enum...OK\nAll 9 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#backingInt\">@backingInt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#fromBackingInt\">@fromBackingInt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#typeInfo\">@typeInfo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#tagName\">@tagName</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#sizeOf\">@sizeOf</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/noreturn/#noreturn\">noreturn</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n      <h3 id=\"extern-enum\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/enum/#extern-enum\">extern enum</a></h3>\n\n      <p>默认情况下，不保证枚举兼容 C ABI：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">enum_export_error.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Foo = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span> { a, b, c };\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">export</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">entry</span>(foo: Foo) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    _ = foo;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-obj enum_export_error.zig -target x86_64-linux</kbd>\n<span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/enum_export_error.zig:2:17: </span><span class=\"sgr-31m\">error: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">parameter of type 'enum_export_error.Foo' not allowed in function with calling convention 'x86_64_sysv'\n</span>export fn entry(foo: Foo) void {\n                <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^~~~~~~~\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/enum_export_error.zig:1:13: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">integer tag type of enum is inferred\n</span>const Foo = enum { a, b, c };\n            <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/enum_export_error.zig:1:13: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">consider explicitly specifying the integer tag type\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/enum_export_error.zig:1:13: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">enum declared here\n</span><span class=\"sgr-2m\">referenced by:\n    root: /home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:13:22\n    comptime: /home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:20:9\n    2 reference(s) hidden; use '-freference-trace=4' to see all references\n</span>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>若要使枚举兼容 C ABI，应显式提供枚举的标记类型：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">enum_export.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Foo = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">c_int</span>) { a, b, c };\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">export</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">entry</span>(foo: Foo) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    _ = foo;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-obj enum_export.zig</kbd>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Enum-Literals\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/enum/#Enum-Literals\">枚举字面量</a></h3>\n\n      <p>枚举字面量允许只指定枚举字段名，不指定枚举类型：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_enum_literals.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expect = std.testing.expect;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Color = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span> {\n    auto,\n    off,\n    on,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"enum literals\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> color1: Color = .auto;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> color2 = Color.auto;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(color1, color2);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"switch using enum literals\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> color = Color.on;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> result = <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (color) {\n        .auto =&gt; <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span>,\n        .on =&gt; <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>,\n        .off =&gt; <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span>,\n    };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(result);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_enum_literals.zig</kbd>\n1/2 test_enum_literals.test.enum literals...OK\n2/2 test_enum_literals.test.switch using enum literals...OK\nAll 2 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Non-exhaustive-enum\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/enum/#Non-exhaustive-enum\">非穷尽枚举</a></h3>\n\n      <p>在末尾添加 <code>_</code> 字段即可创建非穷尽枚举。该枚举必须指定标记类型，且不能用尽所有可能的枚举值。</p>\n      <p>对非穷尽枚举调用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#fromBackingInt\">@fromBackingInt</a>，始终会得到有效的枚举值。</p>\n      <p>对非穷尽枚举执行 switch 时，可以使用 <code>_</code> 分支替代 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span></code> 分支。使用 <code>_</code> 分支时，如果 switch 未处理所有已知标记名称，编译器会报错。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_switch_non-exhaustive.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expect = std.testing.expect;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Number = <span class=\"tok-kw\">enum</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) {\n    one,\n    two,\n    three,\n    _,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"switch on non-exhaustive enum\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> number = Number.one;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> result = <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (number) {\n        .one =&gt; <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>,\n        .two, .three =&gt; <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span>,\n        _ =&gt; <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span>,\n    };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(result);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> is_one = <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (number) {\n        .one =&gt; <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span>,\n    };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expect(is_one);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_switch_non-exhaustive.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_switch_non-exhaustive.test.switch on non-exhaustive enum...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n      \n\n      ","translation":{"total":38,"translated":38}}
